    <briefdescription>
<para>ASL-11: Snapshot retention-policy enforcer. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Scans <computeroutput>config.snapshot_dir</computeroutput> for AI pre-operation snapshot directories (those whose name contains &quot;_pre_op&quot; or starts with &quot;op-&quot;) and removes entries that exceed the configured age or total-size limits.</para>
<para><heading level="3">Thread safety</heading>
</para>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="class_ai_snapshot_cleanup_job_1a74068b7b85406e139e9488b4869bd910" kindref="member">runCleanup()</ref></computeroutput> and <computeroutput><ref refid="class_ai_snapshot_cleanup_job_1ab84d3e74da3cf61fa819c260d15c58dd" kindref="member">listSnapshots()</ref></computeroutput> are stateless after construction; safe for concurrent invocation. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
